---
import Layout from "../layout/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Beca Francia">
    <section class="bg-linear-to-br from-slate-50 to-gray-100 py-16 px-4 relative overflow-hidden min-h-screen">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-3">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-blue-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-72 h-72 bg-green-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow animation-delay-2000"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-100 rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-xl opacity-30 animate-pulse-slow animation-delay-4000"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <div class="inline-block">
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg mx-auto mb-4">
                            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"></path>
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 14v6l9-5m-9 5l-9-5m9 5l9-5"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                        Beca Francia <br>
                        <span class="bg-linear-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                            Programa de Intercambio
                        </span>
                    </h1>
                    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                        Oportunidad única para estudiar en universidades francesas y enriquecer tu experiencia académica internacional
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Imagen de la beca -->
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <img src="/becaFrancia.jpg" alt="Beca Francia" class="rounded-2xl shadow-lg max-w-full h-auto mx-auto" />
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                <!-- Encargada y Coordinación -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-blue-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Coordinación</h2>
                            <p class="text-blue-600 font-medium">Encargada del programa</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-blue-200">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Encargada:</h3>
                            <p class="text-blue-700 font-medium">Rosaura Gómez</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Encargados por Carrera</h3>
                            <p class="text-gray-600">
                                Cada carrera cuenta con un encargado específico para guiar a los estudiantes en el proceso de postulación y preparación para el intercambio académico en Francia.
                            </p>
                            <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">
                                Contacta con tu coordinador de carrera para más información.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Requisitos Académicos -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-green-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Requisitos Académicos</h2>
                            <p class="text-green-600 font-medium">Índice y nivel de inglés</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-green-200">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-1">Índice Mínimo</h4>
                                <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600">6.5</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-blue-200">
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1">Índice Deseado</h4>
                                <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600">7.5</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-green-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                <span class="text-gray-700">Mínimo inglés B1 o B2</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-blue-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                <span class="text-gray-700">Plus opcional B1 o B2 (otro idioma)</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-yellow-200">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div class="w-4 h-4 bg-yellow-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center">
                                    <span class="text-yellow-800 font-bold text-xs">!</span>
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-yellow-800 font-medium">Índice superior a 8: Chance para beca Eiffel</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                <!-- Requisitos Adicionales -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-purple-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m8 0V8a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2V6m8 0H8"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Requisitos Adicionales</h2>
                            <p class="text-purple-600 font-medium">Servicio y semestre</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    1
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Servicio Comunitario</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600">
                                    Completar el servicio comunitario requerido por la universidad.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="flex gap-4">
                            <div class="shrink-0">
                                <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-purple-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-sm">
                                    2
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grow">
                                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">7mo Semestre</h3>
                                <p class="text-gray-600">
                                    Estar cursando o haber completado el 7mo semestre de la carrera.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Perfil Profesional -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-red-200 flex flex-col min-h-[420px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 13.255A23.931 23.931 0 0112 15c-3.183 0-6.22-.62-9-1.745M16 6V4a2 2 0 00-2-2h-4a2 2 0 00-2 2v2m8 0V8a2 2 0 01-2 2H8a2 2 0 01-2-2V6m8 0H8"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Perfil Profesional</h2>
                            <p class="text-red-600 font-medium">Cursos y especializaciones</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-6 grow">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Desarrollo de Competencias</h3>
                            <div class="space-y-3">
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                    <span class="text-gray-700">Cursos especializados en desarrollo</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                    <span class="text-gray-700">Desarrollo de Inteligencia Artificial</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                    <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-red-400 rounded-full"></div>
                                    <span class="text-gray-700">Ciberseguridad y protección de datos</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="bg-orange-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-orange-200">
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-orange-800 mb-2">Cursos Patrocinados</h4>
                            <p class="text-orange-700 text-sm">
                                Buscar y completar cursos patrocinados por empresas grandes para fortalecer el perfil profesional.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
                <!-- Documentos Requeridos -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-indigo-200 flex flex-col min-h-[300px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-indigo-500 to-purple-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Documentos Requeridos</h2>
                            <p class="text-indigo-600 font-medium">Identificación y viaje</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4 grow">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full"></div>
                            <span class="text-gray-700">Cédula de identidad</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-3 h-3 bg-indigo-400 rounded-full"></div>
                            <span class="text-gray-700">Pasaporte válido</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Fechas de Postulación -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group hover:border-teal-200 flex flex-col min-h-[300px]">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-linear-to-br from-teal-500 to-cyan-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-md">
                            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Fechas de Postulación</h2>
                            <p class="text-teal-600 font-medium">Períodos disponibles</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4 grow">
                        <div class="bg-teal-50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-teal-200">
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-teal-800 mb-1">Tiempo Regular</h4>
                            <p class="text-teal-700">Septiembre - Octubre</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-blue-50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-blue-200">
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-1">Con Tiempo</h4>
                            <p class="text-blue-700">Abril - Mayo</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-gray-100">
                <div class="text-center mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">Información Importante</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600">Detalles adicionales sobre el programa de becas</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-green-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Beca Francia</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                            Programa de becas para estudiantes destacados que desean realizar intercambios académicos en universidades francesas.
                            Incluye cobertura de matrícula, alojamiento y manutención durante el período de estudios.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path>
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-800">Beneficios Adicionales</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                            Acceso a bibliotecas universitarias, laboratorios de investigación, eventos culturales y networking internacional.
                            Oportunidad de aprender francés inmersivo y conocer una nueva cultura académica.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    @keyframes pulse-slow {
        0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }
        50% { opacity: 0.5; }
    }
    .animate-pulse-slow {
        animation: pulse-slow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .animation-delay-2000 {
        animation-delay: 2s;
    }
    .animation-delay-4000 {
        animation-delay: 4s;
    }
</style>